Output demo/upload-demo.gif

Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 80ms

Type "# Simple upload — returns markdown"
Enter
Sleep 600ms

Type "npx gitshot rick.gif"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Sleep 500ms

Type "# Raw URL for scripting"
Enter
Sleep 600ms

Type "npx gitshot --raw rick.gif"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Sleep 500ms

Type "# JSON for agents"
Enter
Sleep 600ms

Type "npx gitshot --json rick.gif"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Sleep 2s
